    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"different kind of self.\" that's the thing. i don't want to find a new version of me. that sounds like even more work. it just feels like i was a machine that was built for one specific purpose, and now that the purpose is gone, the machine is just broken. it's just useless weight now.",
